notes.notes:
[b]Fixes[/b]:
- Private rooms turning into public lobbies as soon as someone is invited in;
- In the post-game results, players quitting are being replaced by generic bots;
- Positioning of the winged puck targets in the Drake Vessel minigame makes targeting difficult in some instances;
- Drake Vessel multiplayer stage not staying available in multiplayer matches when the application is closed;
- New Story beacon now made only available once you completed the story mode. "NG+" baby!
- Completing the Oily's Garage match encounter respawning you in the overworld next to the Eastern Fort;
- Golden medal icon showing in minigame post activity panel when no medal is acquired by the player;
- Tutorial can't be skipped without entering it, can't skip tutorial directly from the Overworld;
- Hold Skip button is a tad too slow;
- In the Spindle Minigame, pausing the intro cinematic doesn't actually stop the cinematic;
- Back from the tutorial, the lesson song is stopped after the 2nd lesson in a row;
- Lack of feedback on the iceberg that need to be hit in the Jarl Minigame;
- Wrong texture on Morris' cardboard model texture.
